# Tessera stdlib: the correctly rounded exponential e^x of BF16
#
# x = x1 + x2, where x1 keeps the sign, the exponent and the upper 4 bits of the mantissa and x2 the exponent and the
# lower 3 bits: e^x = e^x1 e^x2, both tabulated as B32 values whose product rounds correctly to BF16. Round to
# nearest only: overflow gives +inf, underflow +0, NaN comes back quiet.
#
# Ported from CORE-MATH, src/binaryb16/exp/exp_bf16.c.
# Copyright (c) 2025 Paul Zimmermann
# MIT license: see LICENSE-CORE-MATH

module Standard/Core

